.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
backend/.venv
backend/.env
# Never bake key material into an image. These are generated locally on first
# startup, and `COPY backend/ backend/` would otherwise ship a developer's JWT
# signing key and credential-encryption key inside the published image -
# enough to forge tokens and decrypt every stored BYOK credential. Production
# supplies them as env secrets instead (app/jwt_keys.py).
backend/keys/
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
**/.DS_Store
